Let $X$ be an object of $\eD^-(\underline E)$ and let $Y$ be an object of
$\eD^+(\underline{E}')$. There is a functorial isomorphism
\[\xymatrix{
  \hom_{\eD(\underline{E}')}(\eL^- f^\ast(X),Y) \ar[r]^-\sim
    & \hom_{\eD(\underline E)}(X,\eR^+ f_\ast(Y)) \text{.}
}\]

